1B2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kol4zYDruEcQ7kNvwEHEWp7&_nc_oc=AdnV1hkFZD4yuyR0n1kZsaDK1hkIAmoBWbQNex-sA0HKnwFyxNGivdFVnrfepFApMLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxTrFs3EFS9ObrztyLRL86FTI1UXN34NCvesaXMf_zNMg&oe=69BE8ED7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K-1-MVwtEEYQ7kNvwHPf-w9&_nc_oc=Adkud-jHVgxFQhWzNHdk_W6EDa0XWGEYgtjOWmRcdx7JFey2S8jY3uMKCHHFKq1cx5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyrffe2ocVoyTQFN6xVMCKLU6npTGF1GFy48B_REscAnQ&oe=69BE9415"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2E5j551KyskQ7kNvwFyDCaX&_nc_oc=Adm5-NaL_u_T9p8x_DYu_jo_to414uyWjsq4efH2sVIGdInPBPJDHLpctRMNn52xbA0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzGpIB4T2vu6qMJTU8_WBioFqfodrVcZK9bFe4z2O2Uow&oe=69BEA7C2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hNEwOZ7TToAQ7kNvwGjzgpn&_nc_oc=AdkAgYpG3IAOL-4zyOx0bLA9ScoJScYSiqskf_ac9pYdcr7s1Z__jLkkV_FqJ0oL5q4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzvE7jNRNKLr1qQ7iyKhV4Xaj0SUKm2JuRqA0XFpyFj4Q&oe=69BE8E44"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ufSjDqV98M0Q7kNvwE-EKNz&_nc_oc=AdlHm_WsPPGeF5cWSoH_qyh4Zc4gjU1DNq8lVoG7skOlEgBGMfMp4HI_UCXCXDAnoYI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxEttk6BB2sN-1yUzp8nX5a0pMdycof8os2OWXBCPP1Jw&oe=69BE86A2"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": 